string speech # the text, that should be played as audio
string gender # voice gender of the audio that is generated
string language # voice language of the audio that is generated
bool join # if this flag is set, the service call waits until auido has finished playing, before returning the result
string tts_engine # empty uses cloud speech when a token is available, else local Supertone
string voice_id # resolved cloud voice id from the shared catalogue; optional on the wire
string turn_id # answer this clause belongs to; empty means it cannot be cancelled by turn
---
